# Google Colab Complete Setup

This notebook provides a complete setup for using Google Colab with Claude AI integration, GitHub connection, and loading housing data.

## Setup Steps

### 1. Connect to Google Drive

First, we need to connect to Google Drive to save our work and access datasets stored there.

```python
from google.colab import drive

drive.mount('/content/drive')
```

### 2. Install Required Libraries

Next, make sure to install any necessary libraries for your project. Here’s how to do it in Colab:

```python
