### 3. Set Up Claude AI Integration

To integrate Claude AI, you will typically need to import it and set your API key. Make sure you have your API key set up in the environment.

```python
import openai

# Set your OpenAI API key here
openai.api_key = 'YOUR_API_KEY'
```

### 4. GitHub Connection

