### 5. Load Housing Data

You can load your housing data from a CSV file or any other sources. Here’s an example of how to load a CSV file:

```python
import pandas as pd

# Load the dataset
housing_data = pd.read_csv('/content/drive/MyDrive/path_to_your_data/housing_data.csv')

# Display the first few rows
housing_data.head()
```

